<title>FINLAND: TAMRO, ASK, YIT NEW IN FOX.</title>
<headline>TAMRO, ASK, YIT NEW IN FOX.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Finnish derivatives exchange</p>
<p>SOM Oy said in a statement on Friday that Tamro, YIT and Asko</p>
<p>will replace Finnair, TT Tieto and Cultor 2 in the FOX index for</p>
<p>the six-month period from August 1.</p>
<p>The FOX index is made up of the 25 most traded stocks on the</p>
<p>Helsinki stock exchange.</p>
<p>SOM announced the change, which is based on trading volumes in January-June,  on July 14.</p>
<p>The FOX index is updated twice a year. It is widely used as a benchmark  by investors.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
